  "note": "From the NVDA 2026.2 Commands Quick Reference, the sections agreed on 2026-10-10: Basic NVDA commands, Navigating with the System Focus, and Browse Mode (its commands, Single Letter Navigation, the Elements List, Searching for text, Embedded Objects, and Native Selection Mode). Keys as the reference writes them; where it gives one key column, the key is for both layouts. Searching for text repeats Find, Find next and Find previous, listed once. passes: NVDA acts on the key and passes it on, so it is labelled on a passed key.",
